@octopus/plugin-workbuddy-auth
==============================

This package is an Octopus-adapted distribution of:

  @magpie-community/opencode-workbuddy-auth
  version 0.2.20
  https://github.com/magpie-community/plugins/tree/main/packages/workbuddy

The WorkBuddy provider logic in index.mjs, opencode.mjs and opencode2.mjs is
vendored from that MIT-licensed package. The adaptation adds Octopus package
metadata (octopus.ui.configSchema) and does not change the upstream provider
implementation.

